| A bare uppercase name in emit position is the empty particle of that
| class: `emit Timestamp to core` means exactly what
| `emit Timestamp {} to core` means (see
| docs/todo/emit-bare-particle-name.md). The assertions mirror
| emit_timestamp.code, so the two spellings are proven identical rather
| than merely both accepted.
{
    emit Timestamp to core get t
    assert t._class = "TimestampResult"
    assert t.value ≥ 1700000000
}
